OL,3,GNEWSAWhat have Reform achieved in
OL,4,AWakefield in their first three months?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarl Johnson has had a whirlwind three
OL,7,Fmonths.
OL,9,FBefore May, he was a businessman who
OL,10,Fwould drive around his home city of
OL,11,FWakefield wishing the potholes could be
OL,12,Ffixed.
OL,14,FAfter standing for Reform UK in the
OL,15,Flocal elections, the keen musician
OL,16,Ffound himself the leader of Wakefield
OL,17,FCouncil after his party won 58 of the
OL,18,F63 seats on offer and ended decades of
OL,19,FLabour majority rule.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
